# Ignore everything in the vault directory by default.
# Only the .gitignore itself and the README are tracked.
#
# This prevents accidental commit of:
#   - Private key material
#   - Personal identity nodes containing real PII
#   - Wallet credentials or passphrases
#   - Ephemeris data files with birth location metadata
#
# To intentionally track a vault file, add a specific negation rule below.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
